.TH "SKOGAI RUNNER-JOURNAL-PROMPTS" 1  "skogai runner-journal-prompts 0.0.0" 
.SH NAME
skogai runner\-journal\-prompts \- only the user's input, one json row per turn
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskogai runner journal prompts\fR [OPTIONS] [FILE]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-last\fR=\fIN\fR
.br
only the last N turns
.TP
\fB\-\-md\fR
.br
markdown instead of json rows
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
.br
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILE\fR]
.br
journal, default runner.journal
